{
  "team": [
    {
      "text": "Josh Barkin is the creator of Tipcast.",
      "dimensions": [
        "team"
      ],
      "type": "team_member",
      "primary_dimension": "team",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Josh Barkin is the creator of Tipcast and has experience building mobile apps.",
      "dimensions": [
        "team"
      ],
      "type": "team_member",
      "primary_dimension": "team",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Josh Barkin's team has previously built reward apps for AT&T, Sprint, and Virgin Mobile USA/Canada.",
      "dimensions": [
        "team"
      ],
      "type": "team_member",
      "primary_dimension": "team",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team has focused on iPhone apps more recently.",
      "dimensions": [
        "team"
      ],
      "type": "team_member",
      "primary_dimension": "team",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team built a prototype of Tipcast but acknowledges that there is much work to do.",
      "dimensions": [
        "team",
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "team",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team expresses gratitude to those who can help make Tipcast a platform for sharing progress.",
      "dimensions": [
        "team"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "team",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team has worked hard to understand their technical limitations through prototypes and iterations over the past year.",
      "dimensions": [
        "team",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "team",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team is confident that feedback and actual usage data will guide their decisions.",
      "dimensions": [
        "team",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "team",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team is determined to build a product that they can use for their own projects as well as for others.",
      "dimensions": [
        "team",
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "team",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    }
  ],
  "objectives": [
    {
      "text": "Tipcast is a mobile app designed to share stories that unfold over time.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The app allows users to follow stories they like as they develop.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The funding for Tipcast was canceled by the project creator on November 29, 2013.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The funding period for Tipcast was from November 26, 2013, to December 26, 2013.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tipcast allows users to create updates to a story in chapters that are 15 seconds long.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Users can upload photos, zoom and pan through them, and add text overlays in Tipcast.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tipcast includes a royalty-free music library for users to add soundtracks.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Users can add voice narration by recording with their smartphone microphone in Tipcast.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tipcast is a platform designed to share developing stories.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The team aims to launch Tipcast in the iTunes App Store by February 2014.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "milestone",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Josh Barkin hopes to change his routine and document his story through Tipcast.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tipcast provides tools for users to share personal, business, or local news stories.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt100__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
